// Issue 2 semantic regression guard: after skipping option capture for
// boolean infix roots, an INLINE safe-index comparison must still be
// bounds-checked (nil on out-of-range), and the comparison must yield a
// plain bool. Expected output: inline-oob-safe
a []i64 = [5, 6, 7]
oob = 9
b = a[oob] == 5
! b -> print('inline-oob-safe')
